# PHYLAX station (Buildroot image).
# The kiosk user: runs PHYLAX Suite (phylax-kiosk.service); no login of any kind. UID as the
# Raspberry Pi OS image (build/config.env KIOSK_UID): the data partition fits every image.
phylax 1100 phylax 1100 * /home/phylax /bin/sh plugdev,video,render,input,audio PHYLAX Suite kiosk
